{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dominate the Skies in High-Octane Drone Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash chaos from above in this fast-paced drone combat game where precision and strategy decide who rules the battlefield. Pilot one of three advanced combat drones, each with a selection of skins to choose from. Customise your drone\u2019s skin colour and hue the muzzle flashes to make it your own. Experience realistic controls and fine-tuned movement for pinpoint accuracy in aiming. Engage in five intense game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle</strong>\u00a0- Every drone for itself in a free-for-all showdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team Battle</strong>\u00a0- Coordinate with your squad and crush the opposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Capture the Flag</strong>\u00a0- All players race to capture a single flag while defending against rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team Capture the Flag</strong>\u00a0- Work together to outmaneuver and outgun rival teams.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hot Payload</strong>\u00a0- A deadly game of drone tag. One drone starts with a ticking bomb - hit another with a missile to pass it on before time runs out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arm your drone with devastating weapons - fire guided missiles, drop smoke bombs to obscure vision, and even ignite explosive gas cylinders to wreak havoc on anyone nearby. With customizable team-kill settings, you decide whether to play it safe or embrace the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight online against players or take on AI in both online and offline modes. <strong>More game modes, maps, drones, skins, and mechanics are on the horizon.</strong> Are you ready to claim absolute battlefield supremacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552870?t=1749457339","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552870/0a72fbea171b22d430459fd93992c5dc87f2bf30/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749457339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552870/f39ac5b85def4124cd672fc4c4acfc2c49c0397a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749457339","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552870/f39ac5b85def4124cd672fc4c4acfc2c49c0397a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749457339","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features intense drone combat with realistic explosions and gunfire. There are no depictions of sexual content, drug use, or self-harm. Violence is limited to robotic drone destruction without any graphic gore or human injury."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dominate the Skies in High-Octane Drone Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash chaos from above in this fast-paced drone combat game where precision and strategy decide who rules the battlefield. Pilot one of three advanced combat drones, each with a selection of skins to choose from. Customise your drone\u2019s skin colour and hue the muzzle flashes to make it your own. Experience realistic controls and fine-tuned movement for pinpoint accuracy in aiming. Engage in five intense game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle</strong>\u00a0- Every drone for itself in a free-for-all showdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team Battle</strong>\u00a0- Coordinate with your squad and crush the opposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Capture the Flag</strong>\u00a0- All players race to capture a single flag while defending against rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team Capture the Flag</strong>\u00a0- Work together to outmaneuver and outgun rival teams.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hot Payload</strong>\u00a0- A deadly game of drone tag. One drone starts with a ticking bomb - hit another with a missile to pass it on before time runs out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arm your drone with devastating weapons - fire guided missiles, drop smoke bombs to obscure vision, and even ignite explosive gas cylinders to wreak havoc on anyone nearby. With customizable team-kill settings, you decide whether to play it safe or embrace the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight online against players or take on AI in both online and offline modes. <strong>More game modes, maps, drones, skins, and mechanics are on the horizon.</strong> Are you ready to claim absolute battlefield supremacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Indivelope Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552870/22fa9599930e1ea144f7dca24fe98e22ad89294d/header.jpg?t=1749457339","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257149470,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149470/mo